<Box style={{width: 1280, height: 720, background: "#FAFAF7", padding: "28px 64px 24px", flexDirection: "column", fontFamily: "PingFang SC"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.40)", letterSpacing: 1}}>AI CODING EVOLUTION / KEYNOTE</Text><Box style={{flexDirection: "column", marginTop: 56}}><Text style={{fontSize: 76, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23", lineHeight: 1.18, letterSpacing: -0.5}}>AI Coding<br />演变指南</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 24, color: "#0F6E56", marginTop: 26, lineHeight: 1.5}}>生成不是瓶颈，交付才是</Text><Box style={{width: 132, height: 2, background: "#1C1F23", marginTop: 30}}></Box></Box><Box style={{flexDirection: "row", gap: 14, marginTop: "auto"}}><Box style={{flex: 1, flexDirection: "column", paddingTop: 12, borderTop: "2px solid #1C1F23"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.45)"}}>01</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 18, color: "#1C1F23", marginTop: 8}}>五层演变</Text></Box><Box style={{flex: 1, flexDirection: "column", paddingTop: 12, borderTop: "2px solid rgba(28,31,35,0.18)"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.40)"}}>02</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 18, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.62)", marginTop: 8}}>harness 里头</Text></Box><Box style={{flex: 1, flexDirection: "column", paddingTop: 12, borderTop: "2px solid rgba(28,31,35,0.18)"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.40)"}}>03</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 18, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.62)", marginTop: 8}}>它是不是变量</Text></Box><Box style={{flex: 1, flexDirection: "column", paddingTop: 12, borderTop: "2px solid rgba(28,31,35,0.18)"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.40)"}}>04</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 18, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.62)", marginTop: 8}}>能不能换</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{flexDirection: "row", justifyContent: "space-between", alignItems: "center", marginTop: 24}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.45)"}}>Ethan Jiang</Text><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.45)"}}>45 页 · 约 85 分钟</Text></Box></Box>
